Installation
============

On SD-card
----------

u-boot-spl.bin.normal.out must be copied to a partition with
partition type GUID 2E54B353-1271-4842-806F-E436D6AF6985.

.. code-block::

    sudo dd if=u-boot.itb of=/dev/sdX1 bs=1M conv=fsync

Replace /dev/sdx1 with the relevant partition on your SD-card.

u-boot.itb must be copied to partition 2.

.. code-block::

    sudo dd if=u-boot.itb of=/dev/sdX2 bs=1M conv=fsync

Replace /dev/sdX by the actual device representing your SD-card.

Please, be check the device name carefully to avoid overwriting
your operating system.
